<workout_file>
    <author>Coach Library</author>
    <name>Endurance 90 L02B - Easy Z2 3x22 @ 60%</name>
    <description>Endurance 90 minutes - level 2 of 10, variant B. Easy Z2 3x22 @ 60%.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 22 min @ 60%, 4:30 @ 50%, 22 min @ 60%, 4:30 @ 50%, 22 min @ 60%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: Three easy blocks with short breaks. Good the day after a hard session or race. Eat 40-60 g of carbohydrate per hour on rides this long.

Estimated TSS: 49.</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
    <tags>
